ADDITIONAL NOTICE

This software is a prank tool intended for use only on machines owned by the
operator or on machines where the operator has explicit permission from the
owner. It displays fake security and ransomware screens and, when built with
the PRANK_REBOOT symbol, can force a system restart. It does not encrypt,
delete, modify or transmit user data and installs no persistence.

The authors accept no liability for misuse, for lost unsaved work, or for any
consequence of running this software on a system without permission.
